---
import SiteLayout from "@layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Rate Card – Good job."
  description="Design and development work by John Basham."
  home={false}
>
  <div class="archive-page">
    <article
      class="hentry page post-359 status-publish type-page"
      id="post-359"
      itemscope
      itemtype="https://schema.org/BlogPosting"
      role="article"
    >
      <header class="article-header">
        <h1 class="page-title" itemprop="headline">
          Rate Card
        </h1>
      </header>
      <section class="entry-content" itemprop="articleBody">
        <div class="wp-block-group">
          <div class="is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow wp-block-group__inner-container">
            <h4 class="wp-block-heading">
              So you’re wondering – how much will it cost?
            </h4>
            <div class="is-layout-flex wp-block-columns wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-1">
              <div
                class="is-layout-flow wp-block-column wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"
                style="flex-basis: 66.66%"
              >
                <p>
                  Well… it varies. Pricing is hard, so I offer these rates as a
                  guide. Hopefully you get a better idea of what to expect.
                  Please reach out, I’d love to chat about your project and give
                  you a free quote.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div
                class="is-layout-flow is-vertically-aligned-center wp-block-column wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"
                style="flex-basis: 33.33%"
              >
                <div class="is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex">
                  <div class="wp-block-button">
                    <a class="wp-block-button__link" href="/contact/">
                      Get a quote.
                    </a>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <hr class="is-style-wide wp-block-separator" />
        <div class="is-layout-flex wp-block-columns wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-2">
          <div class="is-layout-flow wp-block-column wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
            <h3 class="wp-block-heading">Brand &amp; Visual Identity</h3>
            <p></p>
          </div>
          <div class="is-layout-flow wp-block-column wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
            <p>
              <strong>Basic Branding – $1500</strong>
            </p>
            <p>You’ll receive: </p>
            <ul class="wp-block-list">
              <li>3 logotype logo concepts</li>
              <li>A personalised colour palette</li>
              <li>
                Social media-ready profile images; i.e., Facebook, Instagram and
                Twitter
              </li>
            </ul>
            <p>
              <strong>Full Suite Branding – $3500</strong>
            </p>
            <p>You’ll receive:</p>
            <ul class="wp-block-list">
              <li>3 logotype + logomark concepts</li>
              <li>A personalised colour palette</li>
              <li>
                Social media-ready profile images; i.e., Facebook, Instagram and
                Twitter
              </li>
              <li>Typeface pairing</li>
              <li>Style guide</li>
              <li>Business cards</li>
            </ul>
            <p>
              <strong>Motion Branding – from $1,000</strong>
            </p>
            <p>
              Bring life to your branding. Animate your logo or branding
              elements to create emotion and connection.
            </p>
            <p>
              *
              <a
                data-id="https://99designs.com.au/blog/logo-branding/logotype-vs-logomark-vs-logo/"
                data-type="URL"
                href="https://99designs.com.au/blog/logo-branding/logotype-vs-logomark-vs-logo/"
              >
                Logotype… Logomark… What are you talking about?
              </a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <hr class="is-style-wide wp-block-separator" />
        <div class="wp-block-group">
          <div class="is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow wp-block-group__inner-container">
            <div class="is-layout-flex wp-block-columns wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-3">
              <div class="is-layout-flow wp-block-column wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
                <h3 class="wp-block-heading">Web Design &amp; Development</h3>
                <p></p>
              </div>
              <div class="is-layout-flow wp-block-column wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
                <p>
                  <strong>Web Design – from $2000</strong>
                </p>
                <p>
                  A custom creation to make your brand stand out. Includes UX,
                  wireframes of page layouts and the design of agreed
                  wireframes. Price depends on the number of pages required and
                  their complexity.
                </p>
                <p>
                  <strong>WordPress Web Development – from $2000</strong>
                </p>
                <p>
                  <em>For when you want to self-manage your site. </em>
                </p>
                <p>
                  By using a CMS (Content Management System) you’re able to
                  self-manage all website content, saving you each time you need
                  to update or add content. Price depends on the size of the
                  website and the complexity of the functionality required.
                </p>
                <p>
                  <strong>Simple, Static Site Development – from $1500</strong>
                </p>
                <p>
                  <em>For when you’re ready to set and forget. </em>
                </p>
                <p>
                  This is the best option for a simple, few-pages website that
                  doesn’t require regular changes or updates. Future changes
                  will need to be updated by a developer.
                </p>
                <p>
                  <strong>Web Hosting – from $250/yr</strong>
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <hr class="is-style-wide wp-block-separator" />
        <div class="is-layout-flex wp-block-columns wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-4">
          <div class="is-layout-flow wp-block-column wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
            <h3 class="wp-block-heading">Shopify</h3>
            <p></p>
          </div>
          <div class="is-layout-flow wp-block-column wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
            <p>
              <strong>Shopify Consulting – $99/hr</strong>
            </p>
            <p>
              Shopify help includes third-party app installation, theme
              customisations, custom page templates and a host of other
              solutions. All projects will be quoted as a fixed price before
              work begins. Minimum charge of $99.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong>Basic Shopify Setup – from $1200</strong>
            </p>
            <p>
              Help with your store setup including an unlimited free trial
              period, theme recommendation and installation, basic customisation
              to suit your brand’s colour palette and typography, plus
              hand-holding through product and collection creation and setup of
              payment gateways and shipping rates.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong>Standard Shopify Setup – from $4000</strong>
            </p>
            <p>
              Includes everything from the Basic setup, plus more advanced theme
              customisations and custom template design and creation where
              necessary, eg. brand pages like ‘About’.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong>Bespoke Shopify Theme – from $15,000</strong>
            </p>
            <p>
              Guide price for design and development of a bespoke Shopify theme.
              Built from the ground up for speed and to perfectly fit your
              brand’s design and functionality requirements. Includes custom
              templates for products, collections, blog, cart, pages and
              customer email notifications.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p></p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>
